WEBVTT

00:04:27.079 --> 00:04:31.809
and you have to harness them
into a work that is actually useful.

00:04:31.809 --> 00:04:34.049
Innovation is a journey.

00:04:34.049 --> 00:04:36.879
It's a type of collaborative
problem solving,

00:04:36.879 --> 00:04:39.639
usually among people
who have different expertise

00:04:39.639 --> 00:04:41.759
and different points of view.

00:04:41.759 --> 00:04:44.319
Innovations rarely get created full-blown.

00:04:44.319 --> 00:04:46.449
As many of you know,

00:04:46.449 --> 00:04:49.199
they're the result,
usually, of trial and error.

00:04:49.199 --> 00:04:53.399
Lots of false starts,
missteps and mistakes.

00:04:53.399 --> 00:04:56.199
Innovative work can be
very exhilarating,

00:04:56.199 --> 00:05:01.730
but it also can be
really downright scary.